<title>Evaluation of the child with urinary tract infection for vesicoureteral reflux</title>
<graphic href="eee0655-w001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>Child with UTI. Over 2 years of age?</label>
<path target="cell-2">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-4">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-2">
<label>Sex?</label>
<path target="cell-3">Female</path>
<path target="cell-4">Male</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-3">
<label>Febrile?</label>
<path target="cell-4">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-5">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-4">
<label>Antibiotics, ultrasound and/or DMSA scan. VCUG when infection is resolved. VCUG results?</label>
<path target="cell-6">Normal</path>
<path target="cell-7">Reflux</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-5">
<label>Antibiotics and observation.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-6">
<label>Routine care.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-7">
<label>Urine cultures every 3-4 months; repeat VCUG every 2-3 years.</label>
</cell>
</algorithm>
